WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Welcome to Traffic Management. Our first priority is protecting people and keeping vehicle movement safe and predictable.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
At gates, check access authorization under approved site procedures and keep entry and exit lanes clear.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Watch for pedestrians. Keep their routes separate from vehicles and follow approved crossing arrangements.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Manage parking movements and keep emergency access routes unobstructed.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Stay visible to drivers, avoid blind spots, and work within the approved traffic plan and risk assessment.
